&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/GoogleContainerTools/jib"&gt;Jib&lt;/a&gt;是Google Container Tools中的一个工具。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jib builds optimized Docker and OCI images for your Java applications without a Docker daemon - and without deep mastery of Docker best-practices. It is available as plugins for Maven and Gradle and as a Java library.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>